var e=`paid-services-14-days-product-specific-refunds-2026-09-07`,t=`help@file.kiwi`,n=`/refund`,r=`I expressly request that file.kiwi make my purchased Upload-GB available immediately, before the 14-day cancellation period ends. I understand that, if I cancel after the service has begun, I must pay for the portion already provided, and that I lose the right to cancel once the purchased service has been fully performed.`,i=`You may cancel an Upload-GB purchase for any reason within 14 calendar days. If you asked us to provide Upload-GB immediately and cancel after the service has begun, the refund may be reduced only by the amount proportionate to the service provided before your request. Allocation to a Web Folder without actual use is not treated as use. If the required information or express request was not obtained, you will not be charged for service provided during that period. After 14 days, change-of-mind refunds are not available under this policy. This does not affect remedies for non-delivery or a faulty Service, which may include correction, a price reduction, termination, or a refund depending on the circumstances. These conditions do not limit your mandatory consumer rights.`,a=`You may cancel a One-time Download Pass, File Expiration Extension, or other paid service that is not Upload-GB for any reason within 14 calendar days. These products are made available immediately. If you cancel within that period, we will refund the full amount actually paid, including applicable taxes, regardless of activation or use. We do not deduct payment-processing fees or any amount for activation or use. When the refund is issued, any remaining download access, extension period, or other entitlement supplied by the cancelled purchase will be withdrawn. After 14 days, change-of-mind refunds are not available under this policy. This does not affect remedies for non-delivery or a faulty Service, which may include correction, a price reduction, termination, or a refund depending on the circumstances. These conditions do not limit your mandatory consumer rights.`,o=`Your cancellation notice is received on the date you submit it. MiniKiwi will check the applicable refund conditions, determine the amount due, and promptly submit any refund due to Dodo Payments, the Merchant of Record, for processing. All amounts due will be reimbursed without undue delay and no later than 14 calendar days after we receive your notice. Dodo Payments will issue the reimbursement using the same payment method and currency used for the original transaction, unless you expressly agree to another method that does not result in additional cost to you. We will reply to the purchase email address you provide. This is a request for manual review, not an automatic refund.`,s=[{value:`upload-gb`,label:`Upload-GB`},{value:`one-time-download-pass`,label:`One-time Download Pass`},{value:`file-expiration-extension`,label:`File Expiration Extension`},{value:`other-paid-service`,label:`Other paid service`}];function c(e){return e===`topup100`||/^cap\d+$/.test(e)}export{i as a,t as c,n as i,c as l,a as n,e as o,s as r,o as s,r as t};
